		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List &nbsp;(Read 77745 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=864" title="View the profile of Zorlo">Zorlo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 43<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=864"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Zorlo65@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg12837#msg12837"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg12837#msg12837">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1530 on:</b> November 26, 2004, 04:58:52 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">FoT is nowhere near Ascent atm, so there is no real &quot;fight&quot; for 2nd.&nbsp; </div><br />Ok, i come from absolutley 0 knowledge of the two guilds other then what i pick up on here, and from friends i know. However, every single thread i read, one person will say something along the lines of &quot;EiE/DA is the best by far, and FoT and Ascent are fighting for 2nd&quot;. Then, maybe one FoT person will post something about how they agree or whatever. And 500 Ascent people post declaring that ascent is #2, and FoT isnt anywhere near. Listen, i respect Ascent as much as anyone, but my question is: Has &quot;new&quot; Ascent caught &quot;old&quot; Ascent? I saw a post a while ago from Snake, about how &quot;as soon as they get together the people, they will do Inktu&#039;ta&quot; or something, well i mean, as soon as i get together the people i plan to Time flag myself... The facts that are obvious to me are: Neither Ascent nor FoT raids Txevu, regardless of whether or not some are flagged. They both raid Qvic on a regular basis. PG trials are a mystery to me, and whether or not Ascent has more then FoT or whatever, i dont know, but neither are Anguish flagged, and neither are close. About a month ago, i heard that Ascent can not clear Time as fast as FoT, i dont know if that is still true. However, i wont be surprised if an ascent person posts something about how they cleared Time in 3 hours a year ago. Additionally, Ascent is clearly taking more apps then FoT, typically at a lower or equal standard. <br /><br />My point is this: Fires of Time and Ascent are both great guilds, experiencing new content, and raiding on a higher level then 95 percent of the game. However, the constant bickering about who is 2nd and who is 3rd is pointless, untill a more concrete distinction arises, not like &quot;Ascent will beat Ink next week if we have numbers&quot;. You cannot compare Old Ascent to Present Fot. Past Ascent accomplishments might as well be forgotten, untill they are caught and passed. <br /><br />Please though, like i said, i&#039;m not in either guild, so if Ascent has apparently beaten a bunch of trials and soon going to kill everything in tacvi, or whatever, let me know. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12838"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=269" title="View the profile of Ssnakess">Ssnakess</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Gecko not Geico<br />
								Global Moderator<br />
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 309<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/kof1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								die plz<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=269"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.ascentguild.com" title="Ascent Guild" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Ssnakess@mail2hell.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg12838#msg12838"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg12838#msg12838">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1531 on:</b> November 26, 2004, 06:51:04 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&quot;New&quot; Ascent has killed a PG raid, which FoT has not. &quot;New&quot; Ascent has nearly beaten Inktu&#039;ta (final named 29%), when FoT has not even killed the first named of the zone.<br /><br />Once we beat Inktu&#039;ta, we simply need 1 real named, and 4 pushover named kills in Txevu, and we have caught &quot;Old&quot; Ascent.<br /><br />Why everyone insists on calling Ascent new and old is beyond me, we didn&#039;t reform, we lost as many people as FoT has lost recently. Why not divide FoT into two timeframes? I realize that someone will insist its because Ascent changed leadership,&nbsp; but in that case, then the current EiE is the &quot;new&quot; EiE too?<br /><br />The only similarity between FoT and Ascent atm, is we both farm sha&#039;s. After that, the comparison ends.<br /><br />And yes, you cannot compare Ascent prior to OoW with FoT now. But you can compare current guilds, and we are still well ahead of them.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=423577" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.webpost.net/ss/Ssnakess/Ssnakess2D2.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12839"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=267" title="View the profile of Grem">Grem</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 401<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Officer of Fires of Time<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=267"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg12839#msg12839"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg12839#msg12839">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1532 on:</b> November 26, 2004, 07:57:46 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Cause our experiences and knowledge of where we&#039;ve been and how we&#039;ve killed stuff no longer counts I guess.&nbsp; You get mind-wiped like Dr. Light after &quot;old&quot; Ascent.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
