							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=472362" target="_blank"><img src="http://flamevault.com/~grem/Grem-1.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
